{{JPExclusive}}
:''Not to be confused with [[Godzilla Cat (Rare Cat)|Godzilla Cat]].''

'''Cat Godzilla''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked when beating [[Shin Japan Heroes Universe Collaboration Event#Rescue! Cat Godzilla|Rescue! Cat Godzilla]]. It was added in [[Version 12.2 Update|Version 12.2]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 702
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Cat Godzilla
|name2 = Shin Cat Godzilla
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Shin Cat Godzilla''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Cat Godzilla is essentially [[Archer Cat (Rare Cat)|Cataur]] with worse speed and range in exchange for all around better stats against Floating. Floating enemies tend to have few knockbacks, so Multi-Hit is not as big of a deal as it would be against other traits. It is overall outclassed by [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]], but it can have use in early-game.

{{Job|Classification = Midranger}}

